{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1RoZSUyMEJsYWNrb3V0JTIwJTI4MjAxMyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Blackout","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/n5fdpOy2C4tqlPltOxHx1eQ5KDC.jpg","description":"A rag tag band of idiots on the verge of signing a recording contract is sandbagged by their lead singer, Chas Knopfler, into throwing the mother of all parties the night before they embark on a world tour. Eddie Mesmer, the rhythm guitarist, awakens to find his drummer, Toss Dunbar, hanging from a tree like a scarecrow, and the house completely destroyed. Eddie and Toss quickly realize that A: they can't remember anything and B: there's a dead guy in the pool. Now, they have to figure out what happened the night before or their Rock and Roll dream is over.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Comedy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"3.2","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Michael Graziadei","Scott Rosa","Flood Reed","Casey O'Keefe","Autumn Federici","Shanelle Gray","John Joyce","Danielle Coyne"],"director":["Matt Hish"],"released":"2013-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"It was the best night of their lives, if they could only remember.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Michael Graziadei","character":"Chas Knopfler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cVLdj0tltcDRkIU88ENYOc5kYtp.jpg"},{"name":"Scott Rosa","character":"Eddie Mesmer"},{"name":"Flood Reed","character":"Toss Dunbar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6Cve4fhbKIODEG5exspvWrKA7NS.jpg"},{"name":"Casey O'Keefe","character":"Spencer's Fiance","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zUEBv2Sv5WPQl69aB32nl7IvK8w.jpg"},{"name":"Autumn Federici","character":"Jenny","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nYA7E8XcoynUmoXUbACwpoL0x04.jpg"},{"name":"Shanelle Gray","character":"Layla","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/quTr3YmiLibRwwGuSVd4QXjLdDK.jpg"},{"name":"John Joyce","character":"Gunther Shea"},{"name":"Danielle Coyne","character":"Fjs Ho","photo":"https://